{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43488","headline":"谒见日将至双阙 · 无名氏","name":"谒见日将至双阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓色临双阙，微臣礼位陪。\n远惊龙凤覩，谁识冕旒开。\n蔼蔼千年盛，顒顒万国来。\n天文标日月，时令布云雷。\n迥出黄金殿，全分白玉台。\n雕虫意何取，瞻恋不知回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}